; pre.script: the virtionet bench's driver phase, before any stack uses the
; card: s2test, hold, a 60 s torture with 8 tasks, and leak. Results go to
; RAM:pre-*.txt; the last lines list every FAIL and every total.
;   Execute SHARED:vbench/pre.script
FailAt 30
Copy SHARED:vbench/#? RAM: QUIET
Protect RAM:s2test +rwed QUIET
Protect RAM:netprof +rwed QUIET
Version RAM:s2test >RAM:pre-version.txt
RAM:s2test 0 networks/virtionet.device >RAM:pre-s2.txt
RAM:s2test 0 networks/virtionet.device hold >RAM:pre-hold.txt
RAM:s2test 0 networks/virtionet.device torture secs=60 kids=8 >RAM:pre-tort.txt
RAM:s2test 0 networks/virtionet.device leak >RAM:pre-leak.txt
Echo "== totals"
Search RAM:pre-s2.txt RAM:pre-hold.txt RAM:pre-tort.txt RAM:pre-leak.txt "passed," NONUM
Echo "== failures"
Search RAM:pre-s2.txt RAM:pre-hold.txt RAM:pre-tort.txt RAM:pre-leak.txt "FAIL" NONUM
